Stateless Sessions

This is one of the most important settings.

http.sessionManagement(session ->
        session.sessionCreationPolicy(
                SessionCreationPolicy.STATELESS
        )
);
What Happens?

Without JWT:

Login

↓

HTTP Session

↓

Session ID

↓

Cookie

With JWT:

Login

↓

JWT

↓

Every Request

↓

JWT Validation

↓

No Session

The server does not remember users between requests.